# The build context of Dockerfile (beside it; BuildKit reads <Dockerfile>.dockerignore): the superproject checkout.
# The image builds only //submodules/TgVoipWebrtc/tgcalls/tools/cli:tgcalls_cli, so these stay out:
# - build-input: the app's build configuration (API credentials, provisioning profiles), the codesigning checkout and
#   the host's Bazel binary. The Dockerfile writes the empty build_configuration module MODULE.bazel needs.
# - git metadata, bazel's output symlinks, the agents' scratch directories.
build-input
.git
**/.git
bazel-*
.superpowers
.claude
**/xcuserdata
